Description: Lightweight Unbound DNS real-time visualization dashboard
 A single-binary DNS dashboard written in Go with SQLite storage.
 Reads DNS query data from Unbound via DNSTap socket or verbose log
 file, and serves a real-time web dashboard with Top-N query and
 blocked domain statistics.
 .
 Features:
  - DNSTap and verbose-log dual data source modes
  - REST API: /stats (JSON), /debug (Text)
  - HTML dashboard with auto-refresh
  - SQLite storage with automatic data retention

